ADEPT Lab website — licensing
=============================

This repository holds two kinds of material, licensed differently, plus
third-party material that is licensed by neither.

  Site code      MIT License                      Section 1
  Site content   CC BY 4.0                        Section 2
  Third-party    No license granted here          Section 3

"Site code" means the machinery that builds and runs the site: everything under
_includes/, _layouts/, assets/css/, assets/js/, and .github/, together with
_config.yml, Gemfile, Gemfile.lock, and the template markup in the .html files
at the repository root.

"Site content" means what the site presents, and the lab's own artwork:
everything under _data/, _research/, and _posts/; README.md; the prose in the
.html files at the repository root; and the ADEPT Lab logo and icon files
directly inside assets/img/ — every file in that directory except
byu-wordmark-white.svg, which is covered by Section 3.

An .html page at the root holds both: its template logic falls under Section 1
and its prose under Section 2.

Section 3 lists material excluded from both grants. Nothing in this file grants
any right in it.


