-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Section 3 — Third-party material, excluded from both grants
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following is not covered by Section 1 or Section 2. It appears here under
its own rights holders' terms, and no license to it is granted by this file.

1. The BYU monogram — assets/img/byu-wordmark-white.svg

   The Brigham Young University monogram is a trademark of Brigham Young
   University. This file is an unmodified copy of the official artwork the
   university publishes, used to identify the institution the lab belongs to.
   It is not the lab's to license or sublicense, and it is not under CC BY 4.0.
   Its use is governed by BYU's brand policy:

     https://brand.byu.edu/monogram

2. Research figures — assets/img/research/*.png

   Each of these is a figure extracted from a published paper and reproduced
   to illustrate the work it comes from. Copyright in each remains with its
   authors and the publisher of the venue it appeared in, and each stays
   subject to that venue's terms rather than to Section 2:

     medical-dead-ends-fig1.png
         NeurIPS 2021
     risk-sensitive-dead-end-identification-fig1.png
         Transactions on Machine Learning Research (TMLR), 2023
     continuous-time-evidential-distributions-fig1.png
         Interpretable Machine Learning in Healthcare Workshop, ICML 2023
     brave-fig1.png
         NeurIPS 2025
     saint-fig1.png
         arXiv pre-print
     structured-policy-initialization-fig1.png
         ICLR 2026
     isocompute-playbook-fig1.png
         ICML 2026
     when-eos-tokens-disagree-fig6.png
         arXiv pre-print
     lark-fig1.png
         NeurIPS 2026

   Every figure's paper title and link are recorded in
   _data/research_figures.yml. To reuse one, start from the paper.

3. Web fonts

   Lato and Source Serif 4 are loaded at page load from Google Fonts. No font
   file is committed to this repository and none is redistributed by it. Both
   families are published under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which governs
   them at their source.
